    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shattered Bride</i></strong> is a fast-paced 3D platformer set in the haunting underground world of <strong>Cavere</strong>, where gothic cities stretch across the walls of colossal caves and a pale, unnatural glow casts long shadows. You play as <strong>Aurelia</strong>, a fox-like demon on a desperate mission to recover the shattered body of her bride, <strong>Korine</strong>, torn apart in a ritual by the Gopherfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse sprawling, vertical levels using fluid movement mechanics like <strong>wallriding</strong>, <strong>sliding</strong>, and <strong>double jumping</strong>. Strategically place <strong>checkpoints</strong> to master challenging segments, but beware\u2014everything dies in one hit, even you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four unique districts, uncover hidden lore, and slowly piece together a story that twists your understanding of good and evil. <i>Shattered Bride</i> is not just a test of skill, but a descent into love, vengeance, and the rebirth of something ancient and unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not salvation. This is devotion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Shattered Bride</i></strong> is a fast-paced 3D platformer set in the haunting underground world of <strong>Cavere</strong>, where gothic cities stretch across the walls of colossal caves and a pale, unnatural glow casts long shadows. You play as <strong>Aurelia</strong>, a fox-like demon on a desperate mission to recover the shattered body of her bride, <strong>Korine</strong>, torn apart in a ritual by the Gopherfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse sprawling, vertical levels using fluid movement mechanics like <strong>wallriding</strong>, <strong>sliding</strong>, and <strong>double jumping</strong>. Strategically place <strong>checkpoints</strong> to master challenging segments, but beware\u2014everything dies in one hit, even you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore four unique districts, uncover hidden lore, and slowly piece together a story that twists your understanding of good and evil. <i>Shattered Bride</i> is not just a test of skill, but a descent into love, vengeance, and the rebirth of something ancient and unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not salvation. This is devotion.</p>",
